  "contentHtml": "<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/6e143325-c7c7-37f3-3355-975fc53161bb.png\" width=\"628\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span>Hey Brew Shop Fam!<br>Here's an update of what's happening this week - from new&nbsp;beer drops, wine reviews, our current tap list, to upcoming tastings, and more.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/Ta8MWZn9RTx?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SHOP THIS WEEK’S NEWSLETTER HERE</a>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/xjLk58M2Lim?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SHOP OUR ENTIRE STOCK OF BEER, WINE &amp; HOMEBREW HERE</a>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/1d52825a-2287-0d67-c6c6-56ae64cbb9db.jpeg\" width=\"612\" alt=\"RedandGreenIllustratedRetailHolidaySaleInstagramPostInstagramPost45_2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span><span><span>It's never too early to prepare for the holiday season! We're excited to bring back</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> The Brew Shop Beer Advent Calendar</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>! Inside our festive box, you'll find 24 beers to carry you through the first 24 days of December. </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Available in limited quantities and by pre-order only</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>, make sure you grab your box before they sell out!</span></span></span></p>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/e5XrFzJSJ5H?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MORE DETAILS AND PRE-ORDER ADVENT CALENDAR HERE!</a>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/e768b95a-c9a7-c97d-c226-7d99ce5d74d5.png\" width=\"520\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span><span><span>Before we get too far ahead in our holidays, check out our pumpkin! </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>VK Pediatric Dentistry</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> in Arlington hosts an annual pumpkin decorating contest amongst local businesses, with the winning prize being a donation to the charity of the winner’s choice. </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Vote for our Jigglypuff pumpkin</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>, as we look to win $500 for</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> AFAC (Arlington Food Assistance Center)</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> here in Arlington!</span></span></span></p>\n<a href=\"https://us.list-manage.com/_ug68ntx9uV?e=01c6cdb4b7&amp;c2id=78b36ba273cb71acbb53a8fce08ea4f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">VOTE FOR OUR PUMPKIN HERE!</a>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/24272af1-1a57-6861-6710-4edf93e209ee.png\" width=\"612\" alt=\"Grid45WeeklyTasting_6.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>Join us this</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span> Friday from 5-7 PM</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> as we welcome </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Rodopi Selections Wine&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>for our free tasting! Scroll down to the bottom of our newsletter to see the full line-up for next month!</span></span></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/bfbf4c98-73e2-1442-34a9-71d715a698ce.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>🕸️ Big drop from </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Bissell</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>!<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><sp